    October run remediation (RUN-REQ-RELIABILITY):
    
    - agent-runtime: bounded selected-model serving-context discovery
      (llama-server model-qualified /props, Ollama loaded-model /api/ps)
      without inference; streaming requests ask for include_usage; wire
      request ceiling raised to 8 MiB so larger validated contexts are not
      constrained; interrupt/lib unsafe docs corrected to the two
      minimally scoped sigaction calls
    - agent-runner: resolve context/reserve budgets once per startup in a
      shared headless/TUI helper with CLI > configuration > discovery
      precedence and no assumed 8192 fallback; absent capacity fails with
      an actionable diagnostic; resolved provenance recorded in journals,
      run_start and the UI
    - token accounting stays honest: TokenAccounting (provider/estimated/
      unavailable) in progress events, TUI markers, nullable journal usage
      with per-prompt resets and terminal failures persisted
    - length-truncated generations regenerate before any effects with a
      doubled reserve within the shared window/token/attempt budgets;
      truncated proposals are recorded, never dispatched; final answers
      require an ordinary complete stop
    - compaction: capacity-based retention (75% trigger to 65% target)
      instead of a fixed six-group ceiling; outstanding user goals retained
      until an answer completes the task; summaries keep path/offset/digest
      references before lossy prefixes
    - native reads are exempt from the repeat-action breaker with a
      corrective notice for repeated offset-less reads; successful distinct
      outcomes reset consecutive stalls
    - tool results: binary output becomes size+sha256, previews bounded by
      encoded escaped-JSON cost; search/discovery prune generated trees by
      default (include_generated opts in), add literal file_pattern,
      regular-file scopes and skipped/excluded/complete coverage; oversized
      scanned files are metadata-skipped; TOCTOU-safe directory traversal
    - new rust_environment: host-resolved already-installed toolchain
      (project pin or system rustup default, never PATH/repo config)

